---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About GoalPulse"
  description="About GoalPulse: an independent football newsroom writing original Premier League news and Fantasy Premier League tips for fans in the UK, USA, Canada, Australia and Europe."
  path="/about/"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About GoalPulse</h1>
      <p>Football news and Fantasy Premier League tips, written by our own editors — original, verified, and made for fans.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What GoalPulse is</h2>
      <p>GoalPulse is an independent football newsroom. We publish original Premier League news, weekly Fantasy Premier League tips, and beginner-friendly FPL guides for fans in the UK, USA, Canada, Australia and Europe. Our focus is Tier 1 football audiences: the leagues, players and fantasy seasons those fans follow most.</p>
      <h2>Editorial standards</h2>
      <p>Every article on this site is written by our own editors. We do not copy text from other sites. News items are published only after their facts have been verified, and we do not invent scores, results, dates, player prices, ownership figures, injury news or quotes. Strategy guides are written in general terms and do not present guesses as facts.</p>
      <h2>Independence disclaimer</h2>
      <p>GoalPulse is an independent fan site. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Premier League or Fantasy Premier League. Team names and player names are used for editorial reporting only. No club logos or copyrighted images are used on this site; article visuals are original gradient designs.</p>
      <h2>What we do not do</h2>
      <p>We do not sell picks, we do not offer personalised betting or fantasy advice, and we do not run affiliate links or advertising tracking on this site. Tips published here are general strategy guidance for a free fantasy game, and readers should always check the official Fantasy Premier League rules for the current season.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions, corrections or story suggestions are welcome via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Corrections to published facts are made promptly when verified.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
